OL,3,GNEWSARural lives cannot be an
OL,4,A'afterthought', healthcare campaigners
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FRural lives "cannot be an afterthought"
OL,8,Fwhen it comes to health transformation,
OL,9,Fcampaigners have said.
OL,11,FIn a joint "letter of concern" to the
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland Executive, four
OL,13,Fhospital campaign groups have called
OL,14,Ffor a cross-departmental working group
OL,15,Fon rural health access.
OL,17,FThe campaigners have warned that rural
OL,18,Fcommunities "face the real threat of
OL,19,Fbeing cut off from timely access" to
OL,20,Facute and other vital hospital
OL,21,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
