OL,3,GNEWSARural lives cannot be an
OL,4,A'afterthought', healthcare campaigners
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement the Department of Health
OL,8,Fsaid "every decision across the health
OL,9,Fand social care system is taken on the
OL,10,Fbasis of safety and delivery of the
OL,11,Fbest outcomes for all citizens".
